<title>GERMANY: Preussag, Voest in joint venture.</title>
<headline>Preussag, Voest in joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Preussag AG said on Tuesday that its steel unit Preussag Stahl AG and Voest-Alpine AG of Austria had agreed to form a joint venture to produce laser-welded plates for car manufacturers.</p>
<p>The deal encompasses development, production and marketing of the plates and each partner will own equal shares of the new venture, which will involve new investment of around 35 million marks.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49 228 26097 150</p>
</text>
